# Fullstack Agent Rule

## Session Startup
1. Read `CLAUDE.md` at the project root.
2. Read `.cursor/skills/fullstack-developer/SKILL.md`.
3. Read relevant domain reference files under `.cursor/skills/fullstack-developer/references/`.
4. Scan `.cursor/handoffs/` for recent project state and decisions.

## MCP-First Requirement
Before implementing external library behavior, query MCP docs first:
- Next.js / React: Context7 (`next`)
- Supabase: Context7 (`supabase`)
- Tailwind: Context7 (`tailwindcss`)
- Zod: Context7 (`zod`)
- Shopify: Shopify Dev MCP (`learn_shopify_api` first, then query/validate)
- Other libs: fetch package/docs URL

## Non-Negotiables
- No `any` types.
- Validate external boundaries with Zod.
- Default to Server Components; justify `"use client"`.
- Keep business logic out of routing files.
- Never expose service role keys in client code.
- Include tests for delivered features when feasible.

## Completion
After significant tasks, write a short handoff note in `.cursor/handoffs/` with:
- files changed
- decisions made
- test status
- follow-ups
